@startuml U26_ml_training_pipeline_activity
!include style.iuml
title U26 — ML training pipeline (activity, Sprint 6) · services/ml/training/train.py

start
if (KTAS study file at data/ktas/data.csv?) then (yes)
  :load_ktas: semicolons, decimal commas,\nlabel = KTAS_expert;
else (no: documented fallback, risk R6)
  :synthetic(6000, seed 7): physiology by level,\n10% ambiguous labels;
endif
:1. clean: impossible values → missing\n(SBP 40–260, HR 20–250, RR 4–60, BT 30–43, SpO₂ 50–100);
:features(): 17 features shared with serving;
:2. stratified train / test split (80 / 20);
:3. 5-fold CV: logistic regression (baseline),\nrandom forest, gradient boosting;
:4. class weights "balanced" for the rare levels 1–2;
:select by ½ urgent recall + ½ macro F1;
:5. sigmoid calibration (5-fold);\nout-of-fold probabilities → threshold τ on P(1)+P(2)\nfor urgent recall ≥ 90%;
:test set: urgent recall, under/over-triage,\nmacro F1, Brier, confusion matrix, calibration;
:SHAP background sample from the training set;
:6. save models/urgency-v1[-synthetic].joblib\n+ docs/ml/model-card.md + metrics.json;
stop
note right
  Measured on the synthetic data:
  urgent recall 0.899 with τ = 0.23
  (0.696 with "most likely level").
end note
@enduml
